        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\angle CAN=\\angle CBN$, $\\angle ANC=\\angle BNC=90^\\circ$ and $CN$ is common, so $\\triangle ANC\\equiv\\triangle BNC$ (AAS).",
          "worked": "In $\\triangle ANC$ and $\\triangle BNC$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\angle CAN&=\\angle CBN &&\\text{(given)}\\\\\\angle ANC&=\\angle BNC=90^\\circ &&\\text{(perpendicular lines)}\\\\CN&=CN &&\\text{(common side)}\\end{aligned}$$\nTherefore $\\triangle ANC\\equiv\\triangle BNC$ (AAS).",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
